    "char_end": 4754,
    "char_start": 4727,
    "end": 298.599,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 296.954,
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4871,
    "char_start": 4755,
    "end": 305.021,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 298.599,
    "text": "Outside of the diagnostic tools provided by RockShox, it can be more difficult to identify the cause of the problem.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4953,
    "char_start": 4872,
    "end": 309.505,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02",
    "start": 305.021,
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the troubleshooting process becomes easier.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5050,
    "char_start": 4954,
    "end": 314.312,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 309.505,
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to the management of the territory.",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5205,
    "char_start": 5051,
    "end": 322.886,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 314.312,
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes truly interesting, because the compromises involved in managing the territory touch upon everything we've discussed.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5229,
    "char_start": 5206,
    "end": 324.304,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 322.886,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5302,
    "char_start": 5230,
    "end": 328.745,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02",
    "start": 324.304,
    "text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5399,
    "char_start": 5303,
    "end": 333.993,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 328.745,
    "text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5456,
    "char_start": 5400,
    "end": 337.055,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 333.993,
    "text": "We've seen it happen with teams using RockShox products.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5544,
    "char_start": 5457,
    "end": 341.811,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03",
    "start": 337.055,
    "text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5604,
    "char_start": 5545,
    "end": 344.617,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 341.811,
    "text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5668,
    "char_start": 5605,
    "end": 347.614,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 344.617,
    "text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5771,
    "char_start": 5669,
    "end": 353.338,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
    "start": 347.614,
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5858,
    "char_start": 5772,
    "end": 358.165,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02",
    "start": 353.338,
    "text": "The overall picture is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5927,
    "char_start": 5859,
    "end": 363.292,
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01",
    "start": 358.165,
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5996,
    "char_start": 5928,
    "end": 367.334,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01",
    "start": 363.292,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6026,
    "char_start": 5997,
    "end": 369.058,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02",
    "start": 367.334,
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6082,
    "char_start": 6027,
    "end": 373.245,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01",
    "start": 369.058,
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6158,
    "char_start": 6083,
    "end": 378.955,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02",
    "start": 373.245,
    "text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6186,
    "char_start": 6159,
    "end": 381.011,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03",
    "start": 378.955,
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6233,
    "char_start": 6187,
    "end": 383.915,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04",
    "start": 381.011,
    "text": "Marco Bellini, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6252,
    "char_start": 6234,
    "end": 385.338,
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01",
    "start": 383.915,
    "text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6305,
    "char_start": 6253,
    "end": 389.017,
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01",
    "start": 385.338,
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Author's Trails.\"",
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6324,
    "char_start": 6306,
    "end": 390.291,
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02",
    "start": 389.017,
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01"
  }
]
